{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43551","headline":"寄司空曙李端联句 · 耿湋","name":"寄司空曙李端联句","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"长安一分首，万里隔烟波。\n海上青山暮，天涯白发多。\n寻僧因看竹，访道或求鹅。\n云树无猨鸟，阴崖足薜萝。\n醉中留越客，兴里眄庭柯。\n黄叶身仍逐，丹霄背未摩。\n别愁连旦暮，归梦绕关河。\n高柳寒蝉对，空阶夜雨和。\n年华空荏苒，名宦转蹉跎。\n南陌东城路，春来几度过。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"耿湋","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_43551.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43551","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}